      "caption": "Bison builds LALR(1) tables and reports conflicts; precedence declarations resolve them.",
      "narration": "Bison builds LALR(1) tables and reports conflicts, and percent-left style declarations resolve many. Clang instead uses hand-written recursive descent.",
